3. What you make with it

What the Software produces from your work is yours: run reports, logs,
replays and GIF exports. Fortitude Omnis claims no rights in it.

There's one exception. The "clawd" robot style draws a character based on
Clawd, which belongs to Anthropic. This licence grants no rights in Clawd. The
robot style is included for private use only, so don't publish material drawn
in it unless Anthropic has given you permission. The default globe style
belongs to Fortitude Omnis, and you may share what it draws freely.


